  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Now you will learn to mark easily a mine. To mark a mine, the first thing
    that you have to do is mantaining a distance to the mine and in a safe distance
    place carefully a flag (or other kind of marker) in order to let the rest of
    the people that passes close to the zone that they have to keep theirselves away
    from this way and also to make it easier to the deactivating teams to find the
    mine that you have reported in the zone.

    And for this level it will be enough
    to mark them.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
