  m_text: The mines displayed on this table are safe, inert replicas created for
    training purposes only. In this simulation, they can be handled and examined
    to help you learn how to recognize potential threats and understand basic safety
    concepts. It is very important to remember that real landmines are extremely
    dangerous explosive devices. In real-life situations, they must never be touched,
    moved, or manipulated, since they are designed to detonate when disturbed. The
    only safe action is to carefully mark their location from a secure distance and
    alert trained specialists. Always prioritize safety, awareness, and respect for
    hazardous environments.
