  m_text: "\u2022 Classification: Anti-Tank (AT) Blast Mine.\n\u2022 Case Material:
    Steel (Circular).\n\u2022 Explosive Mass: 7.5 kg of TNT/TG-40.\n\u2022 Activation:
    Pressure-operated fuse (150\u2013550 kg threshold).\n\u2022 EOD Protocol: High
    magnetic signature makes detection straightforward. However, operators must inspect
    for anti-lifting devices (e.g., MS-3) installed beneath the mine. If the fuse
    is corroded or an anti-handling device is detected, \"Destroy in Place\" is the
    only authorized procedure."
